khyab pa tshad mas grub cing rtags khas blangs kyis grub pa|{sgra rtag par khas len pa'i gang zag gi ngor/ sgra chos can/ ma byas pa yin par thal/ rtag pa yin pa'i phyir/ zhes bkod pa lta bur mtshon na/ rtag na ma byas pas khyab pa tshad mas grub la rtags rtag pa khas len pa'o/}
